While I tend to agree with you on this matter, I would rather see the list
completed. I don't mind if the list I put forward for proposal has to be
changed entirely but so far nobody cared enough of filjvo or even jvajvo to
make a list of them or comment on mine.

Do you have a general rule for jvajvo? Because I couldn't find one.

The only rule that seems universally agreed upon is for {-gau} where {ko'a
rodgau ko'e ko'i ko'o ko'u fo'a} means  {ko'a gasnu lo nu ko'e broda ko'i
k'o' ko'u fo'a}

You're not suggesting that the same rule applies to {-me'a}, right?

remod



